# Product Backlog - Freelance Developer Personal Booking Website

## Epic: Marketing Site
**Priority: HIGH** | **Story Points: 20**

### User Story 1: Home Page with Clear CTA
**As a** prospective client  
**I want to** see a compelling landing page with a “Book Now / Hire Me” CTA  
**So that** I can quickly start the booking process

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Responsive hero section (desktop/tablet/mobile)
- [ ] Prominent CTA (“Book Now” / “Hire Me”)
- [ ] Services summary and trust signals (logos/testimonials)
- [ ] Fast LCP (≤ 2.5s on 4G)

**Story Points: 5**

### User Story 2: About Me
**As a** visitor  
**I want to** read skills, background, and experience  
**So that** I can evaluate credibility

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Markdown/JSON-driven content
- [ ] Downloadable CV link (optional)
- [ ] Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA for text/contrast)

**Story Points: 3**

### User Story 3: Portfolio
**As a** visitor  
**I want to** browse projects/case studies/testimonials  
**So that** I can assess fit and quality

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Project cards with tags and detail pages
- [ ] Case study layout (problem/solution/outcomes)
- [ ] Testimonial carousel or quotes section

**Story Points: 6**

### User Story 4: Services & Pricing
**As a** client  
**I want to** view services and packages/rates  
**So that** I can pick the right engagement

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Pricing table (hourly/packages)
- [ ] “Book Now” CTA per plan
- [ ] FAQ block (revisions, scope, timeline)

**Story Points: 6**

## Epic: Booking Flow Integration
**Priority: HIGH** | **Story Points: 18**

### User Story 5: Booking Widget
**As a** client  
**I want to** schedule via embedded Calendly/TidyCal (or custom)  
**So that** I can self‑service booking

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Embedded/launch widget with configurable link
- [ ] Timezone handling & confirmations
- [ ] Availability sync visible

**Story Points: 6**

### User Story 6: Policies & Notifications
**As a** client  
**I want to** understand reschedule/cancel/refund policies  
**So that** expectations are clear

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Policy page linked from booking
- [ ] Email templates for confirm/reschedule/cancel
- [ ] Optional ICS calendar attachment

**Story Points: 4**

### User Story 7: Calendar Sync (Optional)
**As a** developer  
**I want to** sync blocks with personal calendar  
**So that** double booking is prevented

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Basic sync or documented manual mode
- [ ] Logging for sync attempts/errors

**Story Points: 8**

## Epic: Payments
**Priority: HIGH** | **Story Points: 15**

### User Story 8: Checkout
**As a** client  
**I want to** pay securely (Stripe/PayPal/GCash)  
**So that** I can confirm booking

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Test + live mode switch via env
- [ ] Line items for packages/deposits
- [ ] Success/failure redirects

**Story Points: 8**

### User Story 9: Webhooks & Receipts
**As a** developer  
**I want to** verify payments via webhooks  
**So that** I can record transaction status

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Signature verification
- [ ] Persist TX status and receipt link
- [ ] Email receipt to client

**Story Points: 7**

## Epic: Contact & Social
**Priority: MEDIUM** | **Story Points: 6**

### User Story 10: Contact Form
**As a** visitor  
**I want to** send inquiries  
**So that** I can ask pre‑sale questions

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Spam controls (honeypot/recaptcha)
- [ ] Email delivery & success toast
- [ ] Rate‑limit or basic throttle

**Story Points: 4**

### User Story 11: Social Links
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] LinkedIn/GitHub links
- [ ] Open in new tab with rel=noopener

**Story Points: 2**

## Epic: Admin Dashboard
**Priority: MEDIUM** | **Story Points: 10**

### User Story 12: Manage Bookings & Inquiries
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Filter/search/status updates
- [ ] CSV export for payments/inquiries

**Story Points: 6**

### User Story 13: Settings
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Booking link, payment keys, SEO meta
- [ ] Feature flags (test/live)

**Story Points: 4**

## Epic: SEO & Security
**Priority: MEDIUM** | **Story Points: 8**

### User Story 14: SEO/SSL/Security Headers
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Meta tags, sitemap, robots, OpenGraph
- [ ] SSL cert + security headers
- [ ] Lighthouse SEO ≥ 90

**Story Points: 8**

## Epic: Deployment & Documentation
**Priority: LOW** | **Story Points: 6**

### User Story 15: Staging/Production & Docs
**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Staging deploy (Docker/Vercel)
- [ ] Environment variables documented
- [ ] README + runbook + troubleshooting

**Story Points: 6**
